caption: Constructs
tradition-component: constructs

Frequently, High Magic will create constructs, which follow somewhat different rules.

Damage: 1d6 per 5 points of margin

Healing: N/A.

Mass: Use the applicable table, divided among the number of constructs actually generated.

Number of Constructs: equal to margin of success, at best.

Area: None

Duration: Use the applicable table.

Range in Time: Use the applicable table, subject to the normal High Magic restriction: sensory effects or future triggers only; High Magic cannot travel through time.

Character Points: 10 character points per margin of success, divided among constructs.
